# **Physical Home Lab & SSH Remote Management — Command Reference**

This covers the physical lab we built before the IPsec VPN implementation, including VLANs, management interfaces, routing, SSH configuration, legacy SSH compatibility, privilege levels, and troubleshooting.

All private IP addresses, usernames, and passwords are replaced with placeholders. **No IPsec, IKEv2, VPN certificates, or tunnel configuration commands are included.**

This is a reconstruction of our build, not a verbatim console history. Unconfirmed switchport numbers are represented by placeholders.

## **1. Physical topology**

Logical baseline topology before VPN integration.

| Device | Model               | Function            |
| ------ | ------------------- | ------------------- |
| SW1    | Cisco Catalyst 3560 | Layer 2 switching   |
| R1     | Cisco 881           | Physical lab router |
| R2     | Cisco 892F          | Physical lab router |
| ISP    | AT&T BGW320-500     | Internet gateway    |
| Laptop | Windows 11          | SSH management      |

